    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twinspell is a cooperative roguelike dungeon crawler where players control two characters on an epic journey through alternate dimensions. Together, they must explore procedurally generated dungeons and face powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fast-paced, strategic action gameplay, players must balance exploration, combat, and collecting passive relics to strengthen their abilities. Each victory grants experience and new progression options, while each defeat is a chance to learn from mistakes and try again in a completely new dungeon. Prepare for unique challenges each time you play, where cooperation between characters is the key to survival.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twinspell is a cooperative roguelike dungeon crawler where players control two characters on an epic journey through alternate dimensions. Together, they must explore procedurally generated dungeons and face powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fast-paced, strategic action gameplay, players must balance exploration, combat, and collecting passive relics to strengthen their abilities. Each victory grants experience and new progression options, while each defeat is a chance to learn from mistakes and try again in a completely new dungeon. Prepare for unique challenges each time you play, where cooperation between characters is the key to survival.</p>",
    "short_description": "Twinspell is a cooperative roguelike where two players explore procedural dungeons and face enemies in fast-paced, frenetic combat.",
